{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212060","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621206001:0":{"text":"小さな命は、いつだって誰かが守ってあげなきゃいけないんだよね。","source_cn":"总有些小生命需要我们的守望，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FEABD710F5E211E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621206002:0":{"text":"僕はハーメル、君たちのようなメイジさんとお知り合いになれて光栄だよ……","source_cn":"我叫哈梅尔，很荣幸能结识两位魔法师朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9108045178640A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1621206002":{"text":"僕はハーメル、君たちのようなメイジさんとお知り合いになれて光栄だよ……","source_cn":"我叫哈梅尔，很荣幸能结识两位魔法师朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9108045178640A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621206003:1":{"text":"つける？とんでもない……「風に運ばれてきた」とでも言っておくよ。","source_cn":"跟踪？不不，我更愿意称之为——随风而行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA8858E57D6944F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621206004:1":{"text":"とにかく、僕は導きに従って来ただけだよ。","source_cn":"我只是一个遵从指引的人，来到此地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8784488782D4A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621206005:1":{"text":"これまでの経験から、風が紡ぐ物語にはいつも良い結末が訪れる……そして僕たちは、その物語に生きるただの登場人物に過ぎないんだ。","source_cn":"不过，就我过往的经验来看，风编织的故事，总会有一个好结...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A0DBF7C950E325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"僕たちをつけてたのか？","source_cn":"你在跟踪我们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDF8AB56CD702A23C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"僕たちをつけてたのか？","female":"私たちをつけてたの？","variant_male_record_index":"83683","variant_female_record_index":"83684","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621206006:0":{"text":"名前なんて、ただのラベルに過ぎないんだけどね……","source_cn":"名字只是尘世的标签，不过既然你问了，我也不打算卖关子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2ACC90DBED91116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621206007:0":{"text":"僕の名はハーメル・シルヴェン。旅人なのに歩くのが遅く、笛吹きなのに音痴……あとは、動物保護協会のメンバーでもあるよ。","source_cn":"我的全名为哈梅尔·西尔文，一个走路太慢的旅人，一个五音...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x523D659A72B9EC6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621206008:0":{"text":"ほかの二つとは違って、動物の保護だけは常に全力で取り組んでる。","source_cn":"不过与前两个身份不同，保护动物这件事，我从未懈怠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4914363F38F87A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"もう一度名乗ってくれるか？","source_cn":"你是谁","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9AB66815D33FD681","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"もう一度名乗ってくれるか？","female":"もう一度名乗ってくれる？","variant_male_record_index":"83685","variant_female_record_index":"83686","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621206009:1":{"text":"あいにく星空を見上げることに慣れていて、足元の道には疎いんだ。","source_cn":"也许是因为我习惯仰望星辰，而不是脚下的路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x976F4030D3C8EFBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621206010:1":{"text":"でも、君の言うとおりだ。この地は僕の笛の音は受け入れてくれたけど、僕の根ではないよ。","source_cn":"你说得对，这片土地容纳了我的笛声，却不是我的根。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E347F7B52345634","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:2:3":{"text":"この辺りの人じゃなさそうだな？","source_cn":"你不像本地人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E348C347CD46411","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"この辺りの人じゃなさそうだな？","female":"この辺りの人じゃなさそうね？","variant_male_record_index":"83687","variant_female_record_index":"83688","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621206011:1":{"text":"もちろん、病状を調べて治療するためだよ。あらかじめ忠告しておくけど、この子たちの命は刻一刻と削られている。これ以上治療が遅れれば、おそらく……","source_cn":"当然是为这些小家伙们排查病情和治疗。不过我不得不提醒两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B2F70DFA7967C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621206012:0":{"text":"でも……","source_cn":"可是……<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD15586FCB1D7EC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1621206013:0":{"text":"お二人がためらうのも分かるけど、どうか任せてほしい。僕には彼らを驚かせることなく、傷ついたリスを見つけ出すささやかな技があるんだ。","source_cn":"两位的犹豫我能理解。不过恰巧，我掌握一项小小的技艺，能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB12FD378E225A86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621206014:0":{"text":"ハーメルは懐からそっと古びた笛を取り出した。色褪せた笛身が陽光の下でほのかな光を放っている。","source_cn":"哈梅尔从怀中缓缓取出一支古旧的笛子，褪色的笛身在太阳下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6A9F3F7037CE21D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:17::0":{"text":"笛","source_cn":"笛子","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6EC3F215D5DBA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621206015:1":{"text":"あなたは思わず眉をひそめた……獣使いの技か？それとも音律を操る魔法か？","source_cn":"你下意识皱了皱眉——驯兽人的把戏？还是那种音律魔法？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x908154E1BA70A96D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたは思わず眉をひそめた……獣使いの技か？それとも音律を操る魔法か？","female":"あなたは思わず眉をひそめた……獣使いの技か？それとも音律を操る魔法か？","variant_male_record_index":"206538","variant_female_record_index":"206539","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1621206016:0":{"text":"いや、古い文献で読んだことがある。たったひとつの旋律で、生き物を操る術があるのだと……","source_cn":"你曾在古籍中读到过类似的法术，只需一段旋律，就能操控生灵。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xADF33EB3AC21E423","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"いや、古い文献で読んだことがある。たったひとつの旋律で、生き物を操る術があるのだと……","female":"いや、古い文献で読んだことがある。たったひとつの旋律で、生き物を操る術があるのだと……","variant_male_record_index":"206540","variant_female_record_index":"206541","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1621206017:0":{"text":"笛？","source_cn":"笛子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24143D1681FBD220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1621206018:1":{"text":"静かに……リスたちを驚かせないと約束する。","source_cn":"请稍安勿躁，我保证，松鼠们不会再受惊了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8757A0D3C202FD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:3:4":{"text":"なぜ手伝ってくれるんだ？","source_cn":"你要怎样帮忙？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0ED1F97767BD36B8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"なぜ手伝ってくれるんだ？","female":"なぜ手伝ってくれるの？","variant_male_record_index":"83689","variant_female_record_index":"83690","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:？？？":{"text":"？？？","source":"？？？","status":"source"},"speaker:哈梅尔":{"text":"ハーメル","source":"哈梅尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:科丝